{"id":"heutzutage","lemma":"heutzutage","pos":"adv","rank":1807,"glosses":["nowadays, these days (in the present era; in the world as it is today)"],"ipa":"/ˈhɔʏ̯.tsuˌtaːɡə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b6/De-at-heutzutage.ogg/De-at-heutzutage.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Heutzutage machen das alle.","en":"Nowadays, everybody does that.","words":[null,{"g":"to make"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"all, everyone"}]},{"text":"Heutzutage tut das jeder.","en":"Nowadays, everybody does that.","words":[null,{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"each"}]},{"text":"Fleisch ist heutzutage teuer.","en":"Meat is expensive nowadays.","words":[{"g":"flesh"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"expensive, dear"}]},{"text":"Kaum einer ist heutzutage glücklich.","en":"Hardly anybody's happy today.","words":[{"g":"barely, hardly"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"happy"}]},{"text":"Heutzutage glaubt niemand an Geister.","en":"Nowadays nobody believes in ghosts.","words":[null,{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"spirit","l":"Geist"}]}]}